Exploit Scenario
The Balancer system is initialized with a cached protocol fee percentage of 10. Alice, a
privileged user, adds a new token with an initial total supply of 1 to the pool. The
management fee calculation determines that the Balancer protocol will receive 10 BPT
tokens and that the pool owner will receive 0.

