Short term, if the _collectAumManagementFees function is behaving as expected, clearly
document the expectations surrounding the function; if it is not, bind the minimum BPT
amount to at least the cached protocol fee percentage.

Long term, analyze all incoming arguments and evaluate whether their bounds are safe.

