Alice sets up a task to dollar-cost-average her 100 million TokenA back to USDC over the
next month. Eve stops Alice’s DCA task. After one month, TokenA's value suddenly declines
to nearly zero. Without her knowledge, Alice’s token has lost all of its value, since the DCA
was not performed after being stopped by Eve without Alice’s approval.

