Description:
The GateThreadBuilder::assign_all method assigns advice cells, enables selectors,
and enforces copy constraints. When the end of an advice column is reached, the witness
assignment process continues with the next advice column from the next basic gate. To
ensure that values are preserved, the last cell of column m is repeated as the first cell of
column m + 1, and a copy constraint is added to ensure that the two cells are equal. This is
done to account for the case in which two basic gates overlap.

