Description:
During the handshake, the peer IP is added into the collection of connecting peers in the
ensure_peer_is_allowed function (figure 22.1), and it is then removed from that
collection after the handshake (figure 22.2). However, since the whole handshake flow is
performed with a timeout by the thread spawned in the enable_handshake function
(figure 22.3), the peer IP may not be removed from the collection on time. If a peer IP is still
