 (stylus/arbitrator/stylus/src/lib.rs#201–213)

The unsafe write function also lacks documentation highlighting its possible misuse:

 unsafe fn write(&mut self, mut vec: Vec<u8>) {
 self.ptr = vec.as_mut_ptr();
 self.len = vec.len();
