Finding: Machine does not properly handle WASM binaries with both Rust and Go support
Severity: Low
Difficulty: Undetermined
Type: Data Validation

Description:
The from_binaries function parses WASM modules from binaries that have either Rust
or Go support; however, the function may detect both a Rust and Go binary at the same
time (figure 25.1). This would cause an incorrect entrypoint code to be generated from both
the Rust and Go support additions.

A user could create a module that triggers both Rust and Go support by creating a function
named run using the no_mangle attribute in a Rust program and compiling it to a WASM
module.

