Due to this, a user is able to provide an arbitrary proposer address for a valid dispute in
order to grief other users, causing them to lose their bond amount.

Exploit Scenario
Alice creates a request through the Oracle contract. Eve submits an incorrect response
and disputes her own response, setting the response proposer address to Alice’s address.
