Exploit Scenario
An attacker has access to a set of potentially valid API tokens. As there is no retry limit for
inputting credentials, the attacker can open a WebSocket and try those tokens until she
finds one that passes the authentication.

Recommendations:
Short term, allow at most one authentication attempt. If that fails, the WebSocket
connection should be closed.

