Description:
The ValidateUnencryptedRanges function checks that the list of unencrypted ranges in
the frame is ordered consecutively and that the ranges are contained within the frame.
However, since the addition of the offset and size of a single range may overflow during
validation, both properties could be invalidated by a maliciously crafted frame.

 // validate that the ranges are in order and don't overlap
