Short term, adjust the implementation of the Harmony proof of work so that the expiration
date is included in the HMAC computation.

Long term, consider unifying the proof-of-work implementations between both Harmony
and Ground Control. This could help reduce the likelihood of other future security issues by
reducing the code’s complexity and attack surface.

