consider tracking a counter of accounts per profile or requiring that an account cannot sign
to remove itself.

Long term, test the system under load and benchmark cycle usage to find methods that
consume cycles disproportionate to the size and number of requests. Consider charging a
nominal registration fee before allowing users to create new profiles and limiting the
number of accounts per profile.

