Finding: The POSIX PlatformFile constructor may block the osquery thread
Severity: Medium
Difficulty: Low
Type: Denial of Service

Description:
The POSIX implementation of PlatformFile’s constructor uses the open syscall to obtain
a handle to the file. If the file to be opened is a FIFO, the call to open blocks the osquery
